      "id": "f",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 488,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 44,
      "text": "The same holds for every partition, because every zone carries one replica of all of them.\nA fourth zone does not raise the tolerance, but it gives you a zone to lose during maintenance.",
      "originalText": "The same holds for every partition, because every zone carries one replica of all of them.\nA fourth zone does not raise the tolerance, but it gives you a zone to lose during maintenance.",
